[{"title":"喜家兄以中自滇南归","author":"王绂","text":"每叹飘零若转蓬，归来复喜两情浓。\n翻思在昔遥相忆，山水几重云几重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26303,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写墨竹遗人","author":"王绂","text":"满几秋阴落砚池，漫涂烟雨墨淋漓。\n不工形似难持玩，一种閒情许自知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26304,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古木竹石","author":"王绂","text":"苍苍寒色未知春，野石荒苔古涧滨。\n一段閒情谁可共，相知殊是寂寥人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26305,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源图","author":"王绂","text":"碧嶂排空隔世尘，几家鸡犬自相亲。\n种桃底事临溪水，惹得渔郎来问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26306,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹","author":"王绂","text":"舟子歌残月欲低，一枝苍翠凤毛齐。\n几番风雨打篷夜，梦入楚云湘水西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26307,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画赠刘巡检","author":"王绂","text":"柳暗花深犬不惊，雨晴村巷绿苔生。\n县中近日无巡警，挟弹来听树底莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26308,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题士女戏婴图","author":"王绂","text":"新剪春衫白苧轻，宜男花放午风晴。\n儿痴未肯离怀抱，却忆当时弄化生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26309,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友","author":"王绂","text":"路极天涯未忍分，一重山外一重云。\n人生自古多离别，江海飘零岂独君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26310,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写古松图寄澄江教谕蔡广文","author":"王绂","text":"长年云气护奇材，鳞满霜皮蚀古苔。\n只恐化龙天上去，清阴不复覆书台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26311,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静照轩 其一","author":"王绂","text":"门掩閒庭草色新，箪瓢穷巷不知贫。\n东风一夜消残雪，花柳眼前随处春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26312,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静照轩 其二","author":"王绂","text":"窄窄轩居傍水开，北窗凉细梦初回。\n南湖新涨雨声断，荷芰触风香自来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26313,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静照轩 其三","author":"王绂","text":"凉雨初收爽气生，竹窗灯火读书声。\n夜深掩卷忘言坐，明月满天风露清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26314,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题静照轩 其四","author":"王绂","text":"寻常客不到山家，松火寒炉自煮茶。\n风雪闭门才十日，不知春已到梅花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26315,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧怀师古庵住惠山并写竹枝以赠","author":"王绂","text":"泉声山色古今同，师去尤能继若翁。\n临别自惭无可赠，一枝聊为助清风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26316,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄乡人","author":"王绂","text":"浪将踪迹寄京华，深负秋香一径花。\n欲托归心向潮水，朝朝暮暮过君家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26317,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读齐威王烹阿大夫事有感","author":"王绂","text":"齐国能强理若何，因封即墨与烹阿。\n唐虞举措无过此，天下那消赏罚多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26318,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其一","author":"王绂","text":"两岸青山夹去程，一江秋水片帆轻。\n寻常对画曾看此，今日分明画里行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26319,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其二","author":"王绂","text":"峭壁一重还一重，江流曲折乱山中。\n船头直望路疑断，才到转湾船又通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26320,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其三","author":"王绂","text":"平生颇得江山趣，肯信江山亦有情。\n自我客行千里远，船头无日不相迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26321,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其四","author":"王绂","text":"怒浪捲花滩上滩，一重山掩一重山。\n无端入峡添狂态，日日题诗未肯閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26322,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其五","author":"王绂","text":"崦里山高多昼阴，未昏烟景暗秋林。\n停舟晚饭舵楼底，犹有夕阳明远岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26323,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其六","author":"王绂","text":"峡里江山总奇绝，推篷不厌去帆迟。\n重来恐忘经行处，一处经行一处诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26324,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其七","author":"王绂","text":"险固山河几战争，阵图犹自列分明。\n至今江水抱遗恨，呜咽古今无限情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26325,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其八","author":"王绂","text":"石转狂湍吼怒声，客怀清夜梦魂惊。\n篙师著力挽舟上，挟向湍流平处行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26326,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡中杂咏 其九","author":"王绂","text":"蜀道古称多险艰，我来观水复观山。\n谁知富贵天然设，身在玉屏金幛间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26327,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨蒲萄","author":"王绂","text":"马乳累累满架秋，晚凉曾剪荐新篘。\n几番月上人归院，珠帐高悬夜不收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26328,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双梧草堂图","author":"王绂","text":"花落莺啼春复深，双梧交映昼沈沈。\n烦君为扫亭前石，待我归来看绿阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26329,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沧浪濯足图","author":"王绂","text":"入郭归来欲暮天，数峰残照半溪烟。\n悠然濯足沧浪上，怕带黄尘上钓船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26330,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为江阴赵以清题捕鱼图","author":"王绂","text":"潮痕日日到门前，供具时时喜斫鲜。\n记得寻君秋色里，邻家多是捕鱼船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26331,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山水小景","author":"王绂","text":"溪水涵秋鹤影孤，草堂云冷树模糊。\n相逢未遂还山约，空复年来喜画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26332,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"王绂","text":"书馆萧条闻夜风，闭门孤坐与谁同。\n谁邻有子灯前读，忘却情怀是客中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26333,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写家山图寄翰林钱仲益先生","author":"王绂"