ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹 其一","author":"王绂","text":"琅玕节节粉痕香，翡翠毵毵凤尾长。\n退直玉堂新月上，一帘风露晚生凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26365,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹 其二","author":"王绂","text":"霓旌翠葆瑞烟浮，禁籞深严近素秋。\n如此一枝何处见，月明凉影凤池头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26366,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹 其三","author":"王绂","text":"凤凰池上影苍苍，退直归来月到床。\n见说立秋才两日，不知风露已生凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26367,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为荥阳宰沈彦初写竹 其一","author":"王绂","text":"宜风宜雨又宜烟，一度相看一洒然。\n有此信知人不俗，绝胜栽柳向门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26368,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为荥阳宰沈彦初写竹 其二","author":"王绂","text":"吏散庭空罢晓衙，湘帘深映翠交加。\n清风一榻琴三弄，笑却河阳满县花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26369,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹送袁文理之官湘阴","author":"王绂","text":"一官千里去江南，写赠琅玕酒半酣。\n彷佛苍龙挟飞雨，散将春意满湘潭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26370,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹送张文惠归梁溪","author":"王绂","text":"退直归来腕已劳，因君灯下又挥毫。\n持归好向人间说，拾得池头綵凤毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26371,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹于沈诚甫来青楼壁","author":"王绂","text":"潇湘江上几千竿，雨雨风风翠欲寒。\n唯此一枝深有意，影随明月过林端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26372,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹题寄华叔端 其一","author":"王绂","text":"我昔寻君扣竹扉，醉中曾写竹间诗。\n别来几度空相忆，多在青灯听雨时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26373,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹题寄华叔端 其二","author":"王绂","text":"不到君家已十霜，种来修竹倚云长。\n月明满地萧萧影，想见幽人咏晚凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26374,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石寄马桓仲","author":"王绂","text":"每忆君家溪水边，排檐竹树翠生烟。\n好教预扫林间石，待我重来一醉眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26375,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石寄李公实","author":"王绂","text":"罨画溪边水拍堤，绕堤高树倚云齐。\n君家正在树深处，满地绿阴山鸟啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26376,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题任月山瘦马图","author":"王绂","text":"千里追风一日还，年来老瘦骨如山。\n多情画史劳传写，不在骊黄牝牡间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26377,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雁 其一","author":"王绂","text":"才见南飞又北飞，飞来飞去不相违。\n惭余壮岁游江海，头白而今未得归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26378,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雁 其二","author":"王绂","text":"声满衡阳月正明，相呼相唤总关情。\n人当客夜孤眠处，听此能无忆弟兄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26379,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题雁 其四","author":"王绂","text":"虞人何用网罗谋，万里高飞且自由。\n肯学鸡凫饱禾黍，一汀菰米楚天秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26380,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"王绂","text":"寻源无复见人家，两岸青山带晚霞。\n莫把扁舟更深入，春流随处有飞花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":26381,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]